flowchart TD
Start["**Start**<br/>Run MOO optimization"]
BufferCapacityProblemClass["**BufferCapacityProblem**<br/>Decision variables x0..x5 capacities {1-10}<br/>Attributes n_replications n_cores base_seed<br/>Method _evaluate uses parallel evaluation"]
NSGA2_Algorithm["**NSGA2 Algorithm**<br/>Sampling IntegerRandomSampling<br/>Crossover SBX<br/>Mutation PM<br/>Termination by number of generations<br/>Method minimize returns result history"]
PopulationNode["**Population**<br/>pop size individuals<br/>Each individual vector x of 6 ints"]
MultiprocessingPoolNode["**Multiprocessing Pool**<br/>Uses n cores to map evaluation tasks in parallel"]
EvaluateIndividualNode["**evaluate_single_individual**<br/>Runs n replications per individual<br/>Uses local RNG for decorrelation<br/>Collects throughputs and wips<br/>Returns objectives f1 average wip min f2 negative avg throughput"]
RunSimulationNode["**run_simulation**<br/>Inputs caps six ints {1-10}<br/>Overrides buffer capacities in system<br/>Runs simulation until SIM_TIME<br/>Outputs throughput wip produced_parts"]
ProductionSystemClass["**ProductionSystem**<br/>Attributes interarrival wip throughput_count defect_count completed_parts<br/>Components loading_robot conveyor washing hantering press1 press2 quality<br/>Buffers post_loading post_conveyor post_washing pre_press1 pre_press2 post_press<br/>Methods source part_flow wip_tracker change_wip"]
MachineClass["**Machine**<br/>Attributes avg_time mtbf mttr energy_idle energy_work resource working processes energy_integral last_load last_state_change<br/>Methods process_part breakdown_process energy_tracker set_load _do_processing calc_mtbf"]
BufferWithTimeClass["**BufferWithTime**<br/>Attributes capacity proc_time store energy_idle energy_work energy_integral last_load last_state_change<br/>Methods put get hold energy_tracker set_load"]
ResultAggregationNode["**Result Aggregation**<br/>Aggregate replication results<br/>Compute avg_wip avg_throughput<br/>Return objective vector to NSGA2"]
ExportCSVNode["**export_history_to_csv**<br/>Input optimization result history<br/>Writes CSV with generation index individual capacities wip throughput"]
End["**End**<br/>Optimization complete and results exported"]

Start --> BufferCapacityProblemClass
BufferCapacityProblemClass --> NSGA2_Algorithm
NSGA2_Algorithm --> PopulationNode
PopulationNode --> MultiprocessingPoolNode
MultiprocessingPoolNode --> EvaluateIndividualNode
EvaluateIndividualNode --> RunSimulationNode
RunSimulationNode --> ProductionSystemClass
ProductionSystemClass --> MachineClass
ProductionSystemClass --> BufferWithTimeClass
RunSimulationNode --> ResultAggregationNode
ResultAggregationNode --> NSGA2_Algorithm
NSGA2_Algorithm --> ExportCSVNode
ExportCSVNode --> End